  "raw_meta_yaml": "{% set version = \"1.1.2\" %}\n\npackage:\n  name: \"io4dolfinx\"\n  version: \"{{ version }}\"\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/scientificcomputing/io4dolfinx/archive/refs/tags/v{{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 592954e9ef4942fef966cba49b131213ff105fa473dd26912c1d2a22fb2392d3\n  patches:\n    - 0001-Increase-tolerance-on-yet-another-test-to-make-tests.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n\n  # openmpi oversubscribe env\n  script_env:\n    - MPIEXEC_TIMEOUT=1200\n    - HDF5_USE_FILE_LOCKING=FALSE # prevent HDF5 from deadlocking on CI filesystems\n    - HYDRA_IFACE=lo0  # [osx] Force MPICH to use the local loopback network interface\n    - HYDRA_IFACE=lo   # [linux] Force MPICH to use the local loopback network interface\n    - FI_PROVIDER=tcp  # Force MPI to use standard TCP instead of looking for HPC interconnects\n  script: {{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . -vv --no-deps --no-build-isolation\n  \n\nrequirements:\n  host:\n    - python {{ python_min }}\n    - pip\n    - setuptools\n  run:\n    - python\n    - numpy\n    - packaging\n    - fenics-dolfinx >=0.10.0\n    - pyvista\n    - adios2  >=2.10.2 mpi_*  # [not win]\n    - h5py * mpi_*  # [not win]\n    - h5py  # [win]\n  \ntest:\n  source_files:\n    - pyproject.toml\n    - tests\n  requires:\n    - python {{ python_min }}\n    - pip\n    - ipyparallel\n    - mpich  # [not win]\n    - pytest\n  imports:\n    - io4dolfinx\n  commands:\n    - pytest --log-cli-level=debug -vvs --maxfail 4 tests\n    - mpiexec -n 2 pytest --log-cli-level=debug -vvs --maxfail 4 tests  # [not win]\n    - pip check\n\nabout:\n  home: https://github.com/scientificcomputing/io4dolfinx\n  summary: Input/Output for dolfinx\n  license: MIT\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  doc_url: https://scientificcomputing.github.io/io4dolfinx/\n  dev_url: https://github.com/scientificcomputing/io4dolfinx\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - finsberg\n    - jorgensd\n",
